    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a transition though. it's like the soul of everything i did died. the community, the influence, the spark... it's all just static now. why keep acting like there's something left to save? it feels like i'm just performing a role for a life that isn't even happening anymore. it feels exhausting to just... exist as a shell.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
