    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to find peace when the person who's supposed to feel it is already gone. i keep thinking... if that version of me is actually dead, then why am i still here? it feels like i'm just a hollow echo. like it would be more honest to just let the nothingness take over instead of pretending i'm still someone.",
